      "content": "It is incredibly draining to feel trapped in a predetermined narrative, as if your DNA has locked you into a rigid storyline that nothing else can change. While genetics do influence behavior and temperament, they rarely dictate a fixed path for the future, especially given the power of conscious choices and supportive relationships. You might benefit from seeking out a therapist who specializes in trauma or codependency, as they can help you challenge these deep-seated beliefs and find new ways to move forward. Remember that recognizing these patterns is the first and most important step toward rewriting your own story, even if the process feels slow and difficult.",
